  "voice": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "text": "Aisha can now set your reminders for you.",
      "start": 0.45,
      "duration": 2.32,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i1.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "text": "Here are four ways she helps you stay on top of your money.",
      "start": 3.22,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i2.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "text": "Let's start with number one.",
      "start": 8.21,
      "duration": 1.94,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i4.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1q",
      "text": "A weekly reminder to tag your payments.",
      "start": 11.52,
      "duration": 2.68,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1a",
      "text": "Untagged payments pile up. On your home screen, a new card offers a tagging reminder.",
      "start": 15.35,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1b",
      "text": "Or just ask Aisha. Remind me to tag my transactions every Friday at six p.m.",
      "start": 21.3,
      "duration": 5.84,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1c",
      "text": "Done. Every Friday at six, Wavvy reminds you to tag.",
      "start": 27.59,
      "duration": 4.26,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2q",
      "text": "Number two. Never miss a bill.",
      "start": 33.0,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c2q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2a",
      "text": "Tell Aisha about the bill. Remind me to pay rent of eighteen thousand shillings on the fifth of every month.",
      "start": 36.91,
      "duration": 7.14,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c2a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2b",
      "text": "She doesn't guess. She asks when you'd like to be alerted.",
      "start": 44.5,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c2b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3q",
      "text": "Number three. You choose the alerts.",
      "start": 49.45,
      "duration": 2.94,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3a",
      "text": "Answer, two days before, and one day before.",
      "start": 53.54,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3b",
      "text": "Your rent reminder is saved, with an alert on the due date too.",
      "start": 57.55,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4q",
      "text": "And number four. Check and tidy your reminders.",
      "start": 63.02,
      "duration": 3.62,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4a",
      "text": "Ask, what bill reminders do I have? Aisha lists them all.",
      "start": 67.79,
      "duration": 4.7,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4b",
      "text": "She even spots a duplicate rent reminder, and deletes it when you say yes.",
      "start": 72.94,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4c",
      "text": "Change a time just by asking. Move my Netflix reminder to eight p.m.",
      "start": 78.03,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4d",
      "text": "Everything shows up in Bill Reminders. Your tagging reminder is in Settings, under Notifications.",
      "start": 83.36,
      "duration": 7.2,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4d.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "o1",
      "text": "Open Wavvy Wallet, tap Chat, and let Aisha remind you.",
      "start": 91.71,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/o1.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    }
  ],
  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "A new *home* card",
      "start": 15.4,
      "end": 21.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Just *ask* *Aisha*",
      "start": 21.35,
      "end": 27.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Fridays at *6* *PM*",
      "start": 27.64,
      "end": 32.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Tell her the *bill*",
      "start": 36.96,
      "end": 44.2
    },
    {
      "text": "She *asks* *first*",
      "start": 44.55,
      "end": 48.45
    },
    {
      "text": "Pick your *alerts*",
      "start": 53.59,
      "end": 57.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Rent reminder *saved*",
      "start": 57.6,
      "end": 62.02
    },
    {
      "text": "See them *all*",
      "start": 67.84,
      "end": 72.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Duplicates *removed*",
      "start": 72.99,
      "end": 77.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Change it by *asking*",
      "start": 78.08,
      "end": 83.06
    },
    {
      "text": "All in *one* *place*",
      "start": 83.41,
      "end": 90.71
    }
  ],
